  "created": "2021-04-16T03:53:06.525Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently Udon gets all prefabs at any path and checks them, but this can be a costly process for projects that has a lot of prefabs.\nIt would be good to have a exclusion list, so that prefabs in those folders don't get checked.\nSince not all prefabs have Udon on them, especially those that comes from asset store packages.\nIt also reduces build/play initialization since you wouldn't have that many prefabs to check",
